          "status": 500,
          "count": 2,
          "known": true,
          "reason": "`launch_app()` and `launch_app_config()` send the community-documented `{\"VALUE\": {APP_ID, NAME_SPACE, MESSAGE}}` envelope. Probing the D24f-J09 showed firmware 3.3.3 answers that shape with the 'Unhandled Exception' page and launches only with the tv_settings REQUEST/VALUE/HASHVAL envelope; the emulator reproduces that crash and logs it as unsupported. Nothing captured answers pyvizio's shape with a launch, so this stays a gap until a set that accepts it is captured or pyvizio adopts the newer envelope."
